    "note": "One name per brand in the Express shop. `names` is NetSuite's brand list, spelled as NetSuite spells it. `codes` maps every ePASS brand code to the brand it belongs to. `epass` is each code's description in the ePASS brand master, so an older record that stored the description still finds its brand. A unit's brand is its model's NetSuite brand when the model is in NetSuite, else the brand of its ePASS code. To fix a name or add a code: edit this file and push.",
