      "odbc/lookup-Brand.csv, the ePASS brand master (167 codes)"
    ],
    "notInNetSuite": "Codes whose brand NetSuite does not carry show the ePASS description, tidied (Weber, Fire Magic, Napoleon ...). Two parts codes, BSH and MAXIT, have no brand of their own and are left out.",
